OL,3,CCleaner finds Mars bar from 1991
OL,4,Cweighing 56% more than today's
OL,5,Cchocolate bar
OL,7,FVictoria Gordon told ITV News how she
OL,8,Fdiscovered a 35-year-old Mars Bar
OL,9,Fwhile cleaning out a woman's home in
OL,10,FScunthorpe, and how surprised she was
OL,12,FA 35-year-old Mars Bar has been found
OL,13,Fin a house in Scunthorpe weighing
OL,14,F62.5g, 56% more than today's 40g bar.
OL,16,FOn August 5, Victoria Gordon was
OL,17,Fclearing out a house in Lincolnshire
OL,18,Fas part of her cleaning service, when
OL,19,Fshe discovered a retro Mars Bar from
OL,20,F1991.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
