FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786477688
OL,3,CCleaner finds Mars bar from 1991
OL,4,Cweighing 56% more than today's
OL,5,Cchocolate bar
OL,7,FSpeaking to ITV News, she said: "The
OL,8,FMars bar in particular stood out to me
OL,9,Fbecause as I actually lifted it out
OL,10,Fthe box, it was like the whole length
OL,11,Fof my hand."
OL,13,FMs Gordon then posted her find on
OL,14,Fsocial media, receiving more than one
OL,15,Fmillion views, and the public
OL,16,Fresponded suggesting she should do a
OL,17,Fcomparison video.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786477688
OL,3,CCleaner finds Mars bar from 1991
OL,4,Cweighing 56% more than today's
OL,5,Cchocolate bar
OL,7,FPopping to her nearest shop, she
OL,8,Frealised today's Mars Bar are a lot
OL,9,Fsmaller, weighing 40g compared to her
OL,10,F62.5g find.
OL,12,FIt was also packed with nearly 100
OL,13,Fmore calories at 270 calories compared
OL,14,Fto today's bar with 177 calories.
OL,16,FMs Gordon said: "Even I was surprised
OL,17,Fabout the difference, actually,
OL,18,Fbecause it looks about a third bigger,
OL,19,Fwhich I don't think anyone was
OL,20,Fexpecting it to be that different.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786477688
OL,3,CCleaner finds Mars bar from 1991
OL,4,Cweighing 56% more than today's
OL,5,Cchocolate bar
OL,7,F"The other one was clearly loads
OL,8,Fsmaller, but it was just so funny when
OL,9,FI initially picked it up out of the
OL,10,Fbox. Look at the size of this. It was
OL,11,Flike a house brick."
OL,13,FMars Bars cost around 30p in the
OL,14,F1990s, which, using the Bank of
OL,15,FEngland's inflation calendar, would
OL,16,Fequate to 71p today.
OL,18,FHowever, supermarkets retail the sweet
OL,19,Ftreat at around 75p up to #1.20, a 69%
OL,20,Fincrease.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786477688
OL,3,CCleaner finds Mars bar from 1991
OL,4,Cweighing 56% more than today's
OL,5,Cchocolate bar
OL,7,FShe was initially going to throw the
OL,8,Fchocolate bar away, but dived back
OL,9,Finto the skip to fish it out.
OL,11,F"I'm really, really glad I've kept
OL,12,Fhold of it now because everybody wants
OL,13,Fto see it," Ms Gordon said.
OL,15,FBorn in the 80s, Ms Gordon says she,
OL,16,Flike others, has felt chocolate has
OL,17,Fdecreased in size over the years, and
OL,18,Fcalled it a "bit of a swizz".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786477688
OL,3,CCleaner finds Mars bar from 1991
OL,4,Cweighing 56% more than today's
OL,5,Cchocolate bar
OL,7,FShe said: "Seeing the comparison, I
OL,8,Fwas quite surprised. Just the sheer
OL,9,Fdifference, it just shows we're not
OL,10,Fimagining it.
OL,12,F"I just think we're being squeezed and
OL,13,Fsqueezed and squeezed and everything's
OL,14,Fgoing up in price and I do think like
OL,15,Fenough is enough. I'm glad I found the
OL,16,Fproof."
OL,18,FHer specialist cleaning company Pocket
OL,19,FRockets regularly finds vintage items
OL,20,Fand antiques when they clear people's
OL,21,Fhomes, but nothing like this, she said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786477688
OL,3,CCleaner finds Mars bar from 1991
OL,4,Cweighing 56% more than today's
OL,5,Cchocolate bar
OL,7,FMs Gordon said she loves looking
OL,8,Fthrough old belongings because it
OL,9,F"really gives you a feeling of
OL,10,Fnostalgia".
OL,12,FShe recalled finding an old Advent
OL,13,Fcalendar from the 80s with just a
OL,14,Fpicture behind the door.
OL,16,F"I literally absolutely love that,"
OL,17,Fshe said. "I don't think I've ever
OL,18,Fseen anything like this where the size
OL,19,Fdifference has been so obvious so it
OL,20,Fwas a bit of a shock."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
