OL,3,CCleaner finds Mars bar from 1991
OL,4,Cweighing 56% more than today's
OL,5,Cchocolate bar
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FPeople from all over the world, as far
OL,13,Fas the USA, have asked Ms Gordon if
OL,14,Fshe plans to sell the Mars Bar.
OL,16,FHowever, the chocolate belongs to her
OL,17,Fclient, so what will become of the
OL,18,Fsweet treat is still to be decided.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
