FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1786477688
OL,3,CCleaner finds Mars bar from 1991
OL,4,Cweighing 56% more than today's
OL,5,Cchocolate bar
OL,7,FThe best before date reads February
OL,8,F1991, and some have even asked her to
OL,9,Feat it or cut it up to film the inside
OL,10,Fcomparison to today's chocolate bar.
OL,12,FMs Gordon is against this, saying she
OL,13,Fdoes not want to destroy it. She is,
OL,14,Fhowever, considering donating it to a
OL,15,Fmuseum or selling it on the owner's
OL,16,Fbehalf.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
